    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Southbound:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Take National Highway No. 1, transfer to National Highway No. 3, and exit at Xiangshan Interchange (towards Toufen / Xiangshan). Continue straight before the entrance to National Highway No. 3, then turn left onto Gongyi Road (Provincial Highway 13). Proceed straight for 3.2 km, turn right when you see the 7-11, and continue for 240 meters. Chia Kuan will be on your left.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
